The matrix logarithm and square root numerical core includes adaptations of
Eigen's MatrixLogarithm.h and MatrixSquareRoot.h, licensed under MPL 2.0.

Copyright (C) 2011, 2013 Jitse Niesen <jitse@maths.leeds.ac.uk>
Copyright (C) 2011 Chen-Pang He <jdh8@ms63.hinet.net>

The adapted sources are provided in src/matrix_operation/schur_decomposition_impl.h,
src/matrix_operation/gpu/metal/scalars_metal.h, src/common/real_result.h,
src/common/square_root_core.h, and src/common/logarithm_core.h in the
LinearAlgebra source distribution and repository:
https://github.com/KhwarizmiAnalytix/LinearAlgebra

Upstream source:
https://github.com/eigenteam/eigen-git-mirror/tree/master/unsupported/Eigen/src/MatrixFunctions

The MPL 2.0 license text is included in MPL-2.0.txt alongside this notice.
